Subject: [Pico Linux] Backport DMA-buffer sync-file import/export to 4.19

Use the Linux sync-file UAPI and preserve independent reservation dependencies.
Keep OR arrays opaque and flatten AND arrays iteratively so repeated imports
do not build recursive fence chains. Retain the 4.19 seqcount preemption guard.
The ioctl handlers follow the existing vendor-5.10 backport in this repository.
The signaled stub follows upstream Linux v5.10 dma-fence.c.

